# 1. Count Elements Greater Than 20

### 🎯 Problem

Given an array, count how many elements are greater than `20`.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p1;

public class CountEleGreaterThan20 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] arr = {10, 25, 7, 40, 15};
        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
            if (arr[i] > 20) {
                count++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Count = " + count);
    }
}
```

### 🖥️ Output

```text
Count = 2
```

### 🔍 Dry Run

```text
10 → 10 > 20 ❌
25 → 25 > 20 ✅ → count = 1
7  → 7 > 20 ❌
40 → 40 > 20 ✅ → count = 2
15 → 15 > 20 ❌
```

### ⏱️ Complexity

* Time: `O(n)`
* Space: `O(1)`

### 🔑 Pattern

```java
if (arr[i] > condition) {
    count++;
}
```

