# 2. Sum of Elements Greater Than 10

### 🎯 Problem

Find the sum of all elements greater than `10`.

### 💻 Code

```java
package p1;

public class SumOfEleGreaterThan10 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] arr = {12, 5, 18, 7, 25, 10};
        int sum = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
            if (arr[i] > 10) {
                sum = sum + arr[i];
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
    }
}
```

### 🖥️ Output

```text
Sum = 55
```

### 🔍 Dry Run

```text
12 → > 10 → sum = 12
5  → ❌
18 → > 10 → sum = 30
7  → ❌
25 → > 10 → sum = 55
10 → ❌
```

⚠️ Remember: `> 10` does **not** include `10`.

### ⏱️ Complexity

* Time: `O(n)`
* Space: `O(1)`

